{#- One promotion, one day: a free cookie for anyone who comes in wearing a
    costume.

    THE TAGLINE is the post: "Wear a costume for a free cookie", biggest
    thing on it (client 2026-10-29).

    THE PALETTE is the weekly post's teal bands top and bottom with a
    Halloween orange body (client 2026-10-29); the orange and why every word
    on it is dark are in fb-costume-cookie.css.

    NO KIDS LINE. Kids get a cookie too, but it isn't advertised (client
    2026-10-29): the post is about the costumes, not about drawing kids in.

    THE GLUTEN WORDING. "Gluten-free", always with the line that they're
    made apart from the regular cooking in a kitchen that also uses wheat,
    on the post, in the caption and on the bag labels
    (label-costume-cookies). The flour is certified and nothing in them has
    wheat, and Mitch mixes and bakes them after close with nothing else
    cooking (client 2026-10-29); the kitchen line is there so someone with
    celiac can still decide for themselves.

    Every size is set for the ~540px a portrait post shows at on a phone:
    nothing a customer needs is under 24px. -#}
{%- set o = site.opening %}
<div class="canvas ck">

    <header class="ck-head">
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero ck-wordmark">
            {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
        </div>
        <p class="p-display-italic ck-kicker">Happy Halloween</p>
        <p class="p-label ck-range">{{ promoDate | dayDate("long") }} &middot; {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ck-body">
        <h1 class="p-display ck-headline">Wear a costume <span class="ck-headline-2">for a free cookie</span></h1>

        <div class="ck-cookie">
            <div class="ck-plate">
                {%- if cookiePhoto | hasAsset %}
                <img class="ck-cookie-img ck-cookie-img--photo" src="{{ cookiePhoto }}" alt="">
                {%- else %}
                <img class="ck-cookie-img" src="/assets/studio/cookie-art.svg" alt="">
                {%- endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="p-display ck-name">{{ cookie }}</p>
        <p class="p-display-italic ck-sub">{{ cookieSub }}</p>

        <p class="p-body ck-fine">One per person, while they last. Made apart from our regular cooking, in a kitchen that also uses wheat. Contains milk, egg and soy; may contain peanuts.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="ck-foot">
        <p class="p-display ck-foot-call">{{ site.phone }} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {{ site.social.website }}</p>
        <p class="p-body ck-foot-line">{{ promoDate | dayDate("weekday") }} {{ o.opens.time | replace(":00", "") }}{{ o.opens.meridiem }} &ndash; {{ o.closes.time | replace(":00", "") }}{{ o.closes.meridiem }} &middot; {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</p>
    </footer>

</div>
